Tests understanding of simple, real-world event-driven flows with per-tenant isolation and reliability basics.

## Key Concepts
- Event Grid triggers
- Storage Queue per tenant
- Idempotency with eventId
- Exponential backoff retries
- Dead-letter queue
- Basic observability (App Insights)

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example of idempotent handler scaffold
module.exports = async function(context, eventGridEvent) {
  const id = eventGridEvent.id;
  // check per-tenant dedup store
  const seen = await dedupStore.contains(`dedup:${id}`);
  if (seen) return;
  await dedupStore.add(`dedup:${id}`);
  await enqueueOutbound(eventGridEvent);
};
```

